      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753734026563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "you want something from fastapi--- \nbefore i give - you need to provide \nsome information.\ne.g /predict/dropout\n\n - patient_id \n - age\n - chronic_cond\n  - etc\n\nReturn\n\n - patient_id\n - probability of dropout = 0.87\n - risk level = medium/low or High\n - recommendation = \"Keep up with your check in times\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "you want something from fastapi--- \nbefore i give - you need to provide \nsome information.\ne.g /predict/dropout\n\n - patient_id \n - age\n - chronic_cond\n  - etc\n\nReturn\n\n - patient_id\n - probability of dropout = 0.87\n - risk level = medium/low or High\n - recommendation = \"Keep up with your check in times\"",
