      "text": "AWS\n\n- open a virtual machine\n- pip install - requirement.txt\n- install docker on linux\n   -- how to install docker on linux\n\n Learning curve \n - linux commands\n     - ls\n     - sudo nano\n     - :qa\n     - :wq",
