      "originalText": "Multi-stage Docker definition\n\n1 - builder stage\n  - pip install requirements\n\n2 - Runtime -- AWS\n - copy /root \n - defining the image -- python 3.11\n - models ----- /models\n - gunicorn -- uvcorn\n - PORT - 8000\n",
